 855+ 8648                  ; setSpriteClip - clip sprites to the play area (below the HUD).
 856+ 8648                  ; Over-border mode is active, so:
 857+ 8648                  ;   - X coords use the SAME doubling as the tilemap clip (copy 2,157)
 858+ 8648                  ;   - Y coords are in sprite space: ULA-origin pixel + 32
 859+ 8648                  ;       tilemap top  pixel 64  -> 64+32 = 96
 860+ 8648                  ;       tilemap bot  pixel 251 -> 283 (overflows) -> clamp to 255
