 126+ 8727                      ; if calling from here then BC must be set with B=row, C=Column
 127+ 8727 C6 30                add     a, '0'                              ; Convert the leftover 1s digit to ASCII
 128+ 8729 CD CB 86             call displayChar
 129+ 872C C9                   ret
