 152+ 875A E6 1F       >        and  $1F                                    ; $1F is binary 00011111 → keeps only the lowest 5 bits
 152+ 875C             >                                                    ; This is exactly the same as (tile_y * 256 + tile_x) modulo 8192
 152+ 875C             >                                                    ; (because 8192 = 2^13 and we are discarding everything above bit 12)
