   1+ 8EA1              playsound:
   2+ 8EA1              ; Input : A = sound fx to play
   3+ 8EA1              ;
   4+ 8EA1              ; routine will choose next available channel and copy sound fx to that channel
   5+ 8EA1              ; IM2 will then process that data
   6+ 8EA1 E5                   PUSH HL
   7+ 8EA2 D5                   PUSH DE
   8+ 8EA3 C5                   PUSH BC
